-All pipelines use the saved 20 repeats of five stratified outer folds, each with five inner folds (seed 20260929). Valid candidates maximize mean inner AUC; exact ties favor smaller mean inner support, then smaller candidate index. The selected model is refitted on outer-training data and evaluated on its saved test set.
