-Development used inspected 129-region outcomes; the 83-region analysis reuses those participants. Nested training cannot eliminate adaptive-development optimism. Repeated participants make fold differences descriptive \cite{varoquaux}. Further work requires independent cohorts, frozen protocols, matched budgets, additional structured competitors, and assessment of age, motion, and medication confounding.
